  "fullContentHtml": "<h2>NTA JEE Mains 2025 Session-I January 2025 Paper-2 Result- Declared - Complete Details</h2>\n<p>National Testing Agency (NTA) Are Recently Uploaded Result for the Engineering Course as B.Tech/ B.Arch Through JEE MAIN 2025 (Session-I) Admission 2025. All Registered Candidate Can Download Result Now in The Given Link Below.</p>\n<h3>Important Dates</h3><ul>\n<li>Online Apply Start On : 28 October 2024</li>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online : 22 November2024 (10:50 PM)</li>\n<li>Pay Exam Fee : 22 November 2024 (11:50 PM)</li>\n<li>Correction/ Edit Form : 26-27 November 2025</li>\n<li>Exam City/ Date Available on : 10 January 2025</li>\n<li>Admit Card Available on : 3 Days Before Exam Date</li>\n<li>Exam Date : 22, 23, 24, 28, 29 & 30 January 2025</li>\n<li>Answer Key : 04 February 2025</li>\n<li>Final Answer Key : 10 February 2025</li>\n<li>Result Declared : 11 February 2025</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Application Fee</h3><ul>\n<li>General / OBC/ EWS :Rs. 1000 to 2000/-</li>\n<li>SC / ST/ PwD :Rs. 500 to 1000/-</li>\n<li>Payment Mode: Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking Fee Mode</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Important Links</h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://examinationservices.nic.in/resultservices/JEEMAIN2025S1P2/Login\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download Result (Paper-2)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://cnr.nic.in/ResultDir/JEEMAIN2025S1P1/Login\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download Result</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://cdnbbsr.s3waas.gov.in/s3f8e59f4b2fe7c5705bf878bbd494ccdf/uploads/2025/02/2025021158.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download Notce for Result</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://cdnbbsr.s3waas.gov.in/s3f8e59f4b2fe7c5705bf878bbd494ccdf/uploads/2025/02/2025021039.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download Final Answer Key</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://examinationservices.nic.in/JeeMain2025/root/Home.aspx?enc=Ei4cajBkK1gZSfgr53ImFVj34FesvYg1WX45sPjGXBpvTjwcqEoJcZ5VnHgmpgmK\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download Answer K